# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  THE UNGUARDED PROOF POPULATION — tests/proofs/*_proof.js and tests/scenarios/*.js
#
#  These are the files gate_harness_isolation freezes: they read DATABASE_URL
#  directly (or need no database). CI runs them in tests/e2e/db_proofs.sh's
#  SECOND section, with DATABASE_URL pointing at a second disposable database
#  built from the chain and HARNESS_DATABASE_URL at the first — different
#  targets, so the same-target guard passes for the right reason. Never run
#  this section with DATABASE_URL pointed anywhere real.
#
#  Same vocabulary as db_proofs.manifest: `run` fails the job, `backlog` is
#  reported with the condition that promotes it. Paths are relative to tests/.
#  First classification 2026-09-04 from a full sweep (CURRENT_STATE #17).
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
